From 4863364d747ac01ce11970d67ab5b50749f85b7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "MOTOR-46 (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:55:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sync: build fixes for the 156 tree (first compile of the sync
 account)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

From LOCAL-19's first compile of 0001-0006 on local/3.1.1:

- account_crypto.cc: BoringSSL of the 156 has no ED25519_SEED_LEN; a local
  kEd25519SeedLen = 32, checked against ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY_LEN / 2 and
  ED25519_PUBLIC_KEY_LEN.
- flyweb_sync_account_infobar_delegate.cc: base::LocalizedTimeFormatWithPattern
  is not in the 156. The date of «borrado pedido» uses the ICU pattern for
  the skeleton "dMMMM" in the UI locale («14 de noviembre», «November 14»),
  falling back to TimeFormatShortDate; //base:i18n and //third_party/icu
  added to the infobar deps.
- brave_sync_handler.cc: missing include of utf_string_conversions.h.
- flyweb_sync_account_service.cc: «fecha» set as a double (seconds since
  1970, exact in a double), as everywhere else in the file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
